3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"neWdmzHgbpqSx62jynDd7A","review_id":"sNW9E-CaFlwC0bbgNq9smQ","date":"2007-11-11T07:11:50","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9254475235939026,"text_excerpt":"had a special event dinner here, hors d'oeuvres on the patio. excellent service. food was good, bisque, salad, fish/steak (though steak could have been better). ambiance nice."},{"business_id":"neWdmzHgbpqSx62jynDd7A","review_id":"A7VGNLk2gv6mqL5Fb74Wkg","date":"2012-01-21T02:26:00","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9241654872894287,"text_excerpt":"We came to Broussard's for group dinner our friend threw; We had a choice of a few entree's and the Redfish was delicious. The house wine was exceptional and service perfect. We had a great time. I would highly recommend it for a party and the food was so good I'd definitely try it for just two."},{"business_id":"neWdmzHgbpqSx62jynDd7A","review_id":"xXY9EdltcwU9hhrHGplz-g","date":"2012-05-20T18:35:14","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9233372211456299,"text_excerpt":"Great meal for a great price. Courtesy of Groupon a co-worker and I took advantage of a ridiculous deal on a great meal at Broussard's. The restaurant itself is beautiful and the food is excellent. The highlights were the Turtle Soup which was loaded with lumps of turtle meat in a rich creole broth. The entree of Redfish Meunière was excellent. My co-worker had an even greater dish, Red Snapper Vera Cruz which had more of a Latin background. It was a huge piece of fish with piles of jumbo lump crabmeat with tomatoes, cilantro potato fingers. Way better than my traditional New Orleans dish. I hope you were able to score the Groupon and take advantage of a great meal that ended up only cost..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"neWdmzHgbpqSx62jynDd7A","photo_id":"jAJigZCkyIgk-ZrpfkRD4g","